# Kind $20's guard with $07 bit 4 (Kind20Carrier, $83:9AC9) and its pot (kind
# $42, Kind42Start $83:C5DE), which no level places: on the first level
# the guard at record $0BAB is put back in its start state ($0C) with $07
# bit 4 set. 10 frames on (the pot made and carried) the guard's record
# is cleared (state 0): the pot finds its guard gone ($83:C606) and
# breaks.
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 30
poke 000BB2 13
poke 000BAB 0C
wait 10
poke 000BAB 00
wait 40
